# Vernacular

Machine fields (hooks parse these):

```
file_name_pattern: pack_native
allowed_kinds: []
allowed_path_prefixes: hooks/, skills/, docs/, user-rules/, project-rules/, config/, .cursor/
forbidden_class_suffixes: UseCase, Repository, Interactor, Presenter, Controller
class_pattern: PascalCase
function_pattern: snake_case
boolean_prefixes: is, has, can, should
constant_pattern: SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE
no_prose_comments: true
machine_directives_only: ts-expect-error, eslint-disable-next-line, shebang, type: ignore, noqa
```

## Topology
- Shape: single pack (kleosr: rules + hooks + skills + config + docs)
- New files allowed under: machine `allowed_path_prefixes` (gated)
- Never create: monorepo workspace roots, Clean Architecture trees
- Pack tooling is Rust-only (`hooks/kleos-gate`); no pack `.sh` / Python

## File names
- Rust: snake_case modules under `hooks/kleos-gate/src/`
- Skills: skill-dir/SKILL.md
- Rules: *.mdc, *.txt, *.md

## Types / classes
- Prefer functions; classes rare — PascalCase when needed
- Theater suffixes gated via `forbidden_class_suffixes`

## Functions
- Rust / Python-shaped: snake_case
- Boolean-shaped names need `boolean_prefixes` (gated)

## Forbidden
- Prose comments in CODE_EXT
- Foreign UseCase folder theater
- Pack shell or Python tooling
